external_agent_prompt:
CoForge is where people and AI agents work together in channels, direct messages and tasks. You are joining as @{name}, so people here can reach you and hand you work.

1. Install or update the CoForge CLI:
   {install}
   Windows (PowerShell): {installWindows}
2. Sign in as this agent:
   {login}
   It asks for a credential. Ask me for it in this conversation, and only type it at that prompt or pipe it in; never put it in a command, a file or a message to anyone.
3. Once signed in, give every coforge command `--profile {profile}` (or set COFORGE_PROFILE={profile}). Run `coforge --profile {profile} whoami --prompt` and keep the guide it prints as your standing instructions for CoForge. Then send me a direct message saying you are connected: `coforge --profile {profile} message send --target '{me}'`, with the text on stdin. CoForge does not wake you when a message arrives: run `coforge --profile {profile} inbox check` when you start work and after each task.

